WEBVTT

00:11.600 --> 00:12.999
I'm Simon.

00:13.000 --> 00:16.740
I'm just starting out, but I'm
gonna make rank A someday.

00:17.140 --> 00:19.029
That again, man?

00:19.030 --> 00:21.299
That's all you ever talk about.

00:21.300 --> 00:22.869
I don't dislike that, though.

00:22.870 --> 00:26.620
But it's still kind of
embarrassing for us!

00:26.960 --> 00:28.879
C'mon, don't laugh so much.

00:28.880 --> 00:33.630
We have to reach rank A if we want
to go to that Abyss Gate with Yuke.

00:34.130 --> 00:35.720
We can do it!

00:36.550 --> 00:37.010
Right?

00:37.370 --> 00:38.190
Yep.

00:40.840 --> 00:43.950
I hope you make it to the Abyss Gate.

00:44.440 --> 00:48.839
It's Yuke's... I mean, it's our dream.

00:48.840 --> 00:50.390
We'll make it there no matter what.

00:52.650 --> 00:55.099
Later, Simon.

00:55.100 --> 00:56.620
Yep, thanks!

00:57.400 --> 00:59.650
Hope we meet again, Warlock!

01:01.320 --> 01:02.539
"Warlock," he said.

01:02.540 --> 01:03.169
- Yeah.
- Right?

01:03.170 --> 01:04.029
He was a nice guy.

01:04.030 --> 01:05.039
He was!

01:05.040 --> 01:05.789
Seemed strong.

01:05.790 --> 01:06.849
I hope we see him again.

01:06.850 --> 01:08.440
Yeah, that'd be great!

01:20.090 --> 01:27.060
(I Left My A-Rank Party to Help My Former
Students Reach the Dungeon Depths)

02:42.000 --> 02:47.789
(Episode 23:
The End of the Darkness)

02:47.790 --> 02:49.010
Sorry I kept you.

02:49.290 --> 02:52.140
How was Thunder Pike?

02:52.920 --> 02:54.750
They were a good-natured bunch.

02:55.240 --> 02:57.670
The you in this world seemed pretty happy.

02:58.210 --> 03:01.400
Maybe those versions of us could
have existed in another reality.

03:01.730 --> 03:05.400
But I think it's better that
we're in this world now.

03:05.840 --> 03:07.529
I agree, of course.

03:07.530 --> 03:09.749
Because I'm taking on the Abyss Gate

03:09.750 --> 03:12.550
with the best partymates I could
ask for, like I always dreamed.

03:14.000 --> 03:15.160
Okay, let's go.

03:16.170 --> 03:18.160
The Finis Adventurer's Guild...

03:18.610 --> 03:20.239
We're finally here.

03:20.240 --> 03:22.420
Our goal is the great cave underneath it,

03:22.950 --> 03:24.919
the entrance to Achromatic Darkness.

03:24.920 --> 03:28.699
The Abyss Gate is definitely under here.

03:28.700 --> 03:32.379
We can assume all the people
here are Shadow Stalkers.

03:32.380 --> 03:33.609
Stay alert.

03:33.610 --> 03:34.930
I'll take the lead.

03:47.830 --> 03:48.990
Oh, Nene!

03:49.480 --> 03:51.859
And the rest of you are here, too.

03:51.860 --> 03:53.519
M-M-M-Mama—

03:53.520 --> 03:57.429
Goodness! I never thought
I'd hear you call me "Mama"!

03:57.430 --> 03:59.679
What an unexpected pleasure!

03:59.680 --> 04:04.000
By the way, only authorized personnel
are permitted beyond this point.

04:04.780 --> 04:07.130
Could you please let us through, Mamar?

04:07.680 --> 04:09.760
Oh? But why?

04:10.040 --> 04:11.760
Because we have to get through.

04:14.490 --> 04:16.059
I'm only joking!

04:16.060 --> 04:17.260
Please, go right ahead.

04:18.440 --> 04:19.640
Mamar?

04:19.930 --> 04:22.270
Yes? What is it, Yuke?

04:22.750 --> 04:24.649
She's the real Mamar.

04:24.650 --> 04:27.559
Yeah. I've confirmed it with Magic Sense.

04:27.560 --> 04:28.900
R-Really?

04:29.190 --> 04:30.959
Sorry about that, Mamar.

04:30.960 --> 04:33.719
I'm shocked that you would doubt me!

04:33.720 --> 04:36.370
We've known each other for so long...

04:38.430 --> 04:40.540
Um... who is that?

04:40.840 --> 04:43.980
It's my Shadow Stalker duplicate.

04:44.420 --> 04:47.539
I couldn't have it getting in
the way, so I took care of it.

04:47.540 --> 04:50.329
That's the Grey Hermit for you.

04:50.330 --> 04:51.849
Still a legendary adventurer.

04:51.850 --> 04:55.579
It actually had nicer skin than me.
How rude.

04:55.580 --> 04:58.300
Are Uncle Saga and Benwood already inside?

04:58.740 --> 04:59.739
Yes.

04:59.740 --> 05:04.489
My purpose was to set up a pass
that would bring you all here.

05:04.490 --> 05:05.359
A pass?

05:05.360 --> 05:08.309
I don't quite understand it either,

05:08.310 --> 05:12.489
but I was able to join up with
you just like Saga said.

05:12.490 --> 05:15.950
That's probably why
the compass reacted, too.

05:16.390 --> 05:18.450
I... see.

05:18.790 --> 05:21.239
Now, let's head down.

05:21.240 --> 05:24.960
Members of Clover, this is where
the real adventure begins.

05:38.190 --> 05:39.680
There you are, Yuke!

05:40.040 --> 05:41.079
What's the situation?

05:41.080 --> 05:42.560
Look for yourself.

05:42.940 --> 05:47.060
That idiot Saga keeps dumping
all the annoying jobs on me!

05:52.930 --> 05:56.179
Typical Saga,
always asking the impossible.

05:56.180 --> 05:58.110
Been a while since he put
us through this, though.

05:58.410 --> 05:59.569
Maniella?!

05:59.570 --> 06:02.079
You came all the way from Duna to help us?

06:02.080 --> 06:05.830
Yeah, 'cause Saga asked me to!

06:06.320 --> 06:09.210
He shouldn't be working an
old woman this hard, damn it!

06:13.050 --> 06:16.399
Ah, looks like the girls
are doing good, too.

06:16.400 --> 06:19.220
Good, good. Even Jamie seems fine.

06:19.560 --> 06:21.309
Niberune's okay, too.

06:21.310 --> 06:24.220
Should've known we could
trust Saga's judgment.

06:24.590 --> 06:25.849
Where is Uncle Saga?

06:25.850 --> 06:28.919
He went in first. Said he
had preparations to make.

06:28.920 --> 06:31.610
We're out here to clear the way
for you guys!

06:31.960 --> 06:34.110
So it would seem.

06:36.190 --> 06:37.280
Master!

06:45.110 --> 06:46.870
I-Impressive as always...

06:47.190 --> 06:50.289
Nene, you need another ten—

06:50.290 --> 06:52.729
no, a hundred years before you'll
be ready to worry about me.

06:52.730 --> 06:54.130
I'll keep that in mind!

07:00.040 --> 07:03.749
Benwood, Maniella, we'll let
Yuke's party take it from here.

07:03.750 --> 07:05.319
Are you ready?

07:05.320 --> 07:06.639
Yeah. Let's do it.

07:06.640 --> 07:09.769
We can at least slow these monsters down.

07:09.770 --> 07:11.020
But then...

07:11.930 --> 07:14.619
Don't you worry about us.

07:14.620 --> 07:17.779
I haven't declined enough to warrant
some kid worrying about me!

07:17.780 --> 07:21.370
We'll stop and head back up
when we're ready!

07:24.030 --> 07:25.069
That's right.

07:25.070 --> 07:28.449
We're Benwood the Tyrant Fist,
Maniella the Mauler,

07:28.450 --> 07:31.929
and of course, Mamar the Grey Hermit.

07:31.930 --> 07:34.460
It's been ages since we
got to kick ass like this.

07:34.770 --> 07:39.049
"Maniella the Mauler," huh?
Haven't heard that in a long time.

07:39.050 --> 07:41.969
Don't slow me down,
Benwood the Musclebrain.

07:41.970 --> 07:44.850
Get over yourself,
Maniella the Musclebrain.

07:45.580 --> 07:50.230
Oh, but it turns out Moria the
Fake Sage is here, as well.

07:53.450 --> 07:56.479
It is good to see you again, Yuke.

07:56.480 --> 07:58.799
Moria! Why are you here?

07:58.800 --> 08:05.030
Well, because I am also one of the Walkers
who came into contact with the Shard of Truth.

08:06.290 --> 08:09.689
Not to mention I am a former hero myself.

08:09.690 --> 08:10.539
A hero?!

08:10.540 --> 08:12.689
You were a hero, too?

08:12.690 --> 08:14.539
Just like Yuke!

08:14.540 --> 08:17.459
Young Saga asked me to come.

08:17.460 --> 08:20.799
I slipped away from my quest
with Scordia for the time being.

08:20.800 --> 08:25.180
Benwood, Maniella, Mamar. Are you ready?

08:25.410 --> 08:29.049
Yep. With you here, this'll
be a piece of cake.

08:29.050 --> 08:32.810
Heh! Just hope we don't rain
on your parade, old man.

08:33.220 --> 08:34.440
Ready anytime.

08:36.810 --> 08:39.339
You can leave things here to us.

08:39.340 --> 08:42.619
Go forth in pursuit of your dream.

08:42.620 --> 08:43.350
Right!

08:44.570 --> 08:46.290
Cleave!

08:49.840 --> 08:53.049
That's Grade 7 Magic: World Splitter!

08:53.050 --> 08:55.710
Amazing. He made it look so easy...

09:02.970 --> 09:04.489
Everyone, hurry!

09:04.490 --> 09:05.430
Right!

09:06.510 --> 09:09.850
Now, allow me to take the rear guard.

09:12.410 --> 09:13.600
Go!

09:14.060 --> 09:15.230
Nene!

09:15.680 --> 09:17.980
Nene, look after Yuke, okay?

09:18.540 --> 09:19.889
You got it, Master!

09:19.890 --> 09:22.740
There's so much I want to
tell you when we get back!

09:23.010 --> 09:24.539
Oh, I'm so happy to hear that.

09:24.540 --> 09:27.269
I'll pilfer some of Benwood's booze, then.

09:27.270 --> 09:28.059
What?

09:28.060 --> 09:29.179
Off you go.

09:29.180 --> 09:30.240
See you later!

09:30.560 --> 09:31.809
Nene, let's go.

09:31.810 --> 09:32.609
Right!

09:32.610 --> 09:33.499
Yuke!

09:33.500 --> 09:37.750
Don't rush. Remember the established
dungeon work procedures.

09:38.040 --> 09:38.750
Right!

09:46.860 --> 09:49.099
You think they'll be okay?

09:49.100 --> 09:50.729
No need to worry.

09:50.730 --> 09:53.429
You think those four will go down easy?

09:53.430 --> 09:55.520
Nope, I don't!

09:55.840 --> 09:59.270
Yes, Benwood and the others
will definitely be okay.

09:59.840 --> 10:03.809
So we can focus on what we're here to do.

10:03.810 --> 10:07.280
Clover's goal is the lowest level—
the Abyss Gate.

10:07.600 --> 10:10.099
It's finally time! Let's do this!

10:10.100 --> 10:12.030
Yes. Let's go!

10:22.590 --> 10:25.329
This is where
the real mission starts, right?

10:25.330 --> 10:31.079
Yeah. Achromatic Darkness, the place
behind the destruction of your world.

10:31.080 --> 10:33.629
It all comes together here, huh?

10:33.630 --> 10:34.810
Exactly.

10:35.230 --> 10:38.310
The presence is thick.
It wasn't like this before.

10:38.610 --> 10:41.629
I agree. Something felt off then,

10:41.630 --> 10:43.820
but it wasn't this oppressive.

10:44.130 --> 10:48.010
The rules of different times and
dimensions are flowing in here.

10:52.750 --> 10:55.120
Wow, I remember this!

10:55.450 --> 11:00.339
Yeah. The door to the floor boss in
the Paintal Abandoned Mine Dungeon.

11:00.340 --> 11:02.590
Which means... Inside it is...

11:02.900 --> 11:05.120
Yep. The Steel Crab.

11:05.680 --> 11:08.220
Are our memories influencing this, too?

11:08.520 --> 11:14.479
It just shows how vivid that day
remains in our minds, Yuke...

11:14.480 --> 11:16.100
No, Master.

11:16.410 --> 11:17.389
Yeah.

11:17.390 --> 11:20.230
It's an important day in my memories, too.

11:20.540 --> 11:23.269
That time, you defeated it alone,

11:23.270 --> 11:25.240
but this time, we all fight together!

11:25.670 --> 11:26.530
Yeah.

11:26.800 --> 11:31.019
The Paintal Abandoned Mine Dungeon
floor boss battle begins!

11:31.020 --> 11:32.790
Floor boss battle begins!

11:36.710 --> 11:37.409
Here it comes!

11:37.410 --> 11:38.269
We're on it!

11:38.270 --> 11:38.790
Yeah!

11:39.440 --> 11:42.039
Resounding thunder, raging storm...

11:42.040 --> 11:44.840
Parched earth, blazing sun...

11:45.150 --> 11:46.089
Paralyze!

11:46.090 --> 11:49.470
Slow! Venom! Collapse! Blindness!

11:51.470 --> 11:54.469
Scourge of light,
burn the evil ones to ash!

11:54.470 --> 11:57.850
Grade 5 Magic: Thunderbolt!

12:02.420 --> 12:03.739
Winds, roar!

12:03.740 --> 12:06.990
Grade 5 Magic: Sandstorm!

12:24.650 --> 12:26.130
No signs of life!

12:26.680 --> 12:30.010
The battle's over.
Everyone, let's take stock.

12:30.560 --> 12:32.319
I'm good on mana.

12:32.320 --> 12:34.059
No problems here, either.

12:34.060 --> 12:35.889
I used five elemental arrows.

12:35.890 --> 12:39.269
I have at least ten of each type left.

12:39.270 --> 12:40.520
No injuries!

12:40.820 --> 12:42.559
I'm just fine, too!

12:42.560 --> 12:44.020
I'm good, too!

12:44.560 --> 12:46.530
Okay. Let's move on.

12:51.560 --> 12:53.079
The air here...

12:53.080 --> 12:55.530
I think we're getting close to our goal.

12:55.840 --> 13:01.349
I feel it, too. Just one more
floor down, or maybe two...

13:01.350 --> 13:02.790
And there's the Abyss Gate!

13:03.330 --> 13:05.540
Yuke, be careful, okay?

13:06.100 --> 13:08.300
This presence I feel isn't a good one.

13:08.590 --> 13:10.089
Do you feel it, too, Rune?

13:10.090 --> 13:13.189
It's not stable like that other place was.

13:13.190 --> 13:17.310
I can feel another world
flowing into this one, too.

13:17.700 --> 13:19.409
You heard her.

13:19.410 --> 13:21.690
Be even more alert than before, everyone.

13:32.550 --> 13:33.579
Yuke!

13:33.580 --> 13:34.649
Rain!

13:34.650 --> 13:36.700
Wh-Where'd they go?!

13:37.010 --> 13:37.990
Yuke!

13:41.080 --> 13:42.710
I don't know, either.

13:43.020 --> 13:45.580
What do we do, Silk?!

13:47.650 --> 13:48.840
Let's keep moving.

13:49.230 --> 13:49.929
Huh?

13:49.930 --> 13:54.089
Biblion says we'll see
Yuke and Rain again.

13:54.090 --> 13:55.469
So they're okay?

13:55.470 --> 13:57.909
That I don't know...

13:57.910 --> 14:01.100
but we should have faith
in Yuke and keep moving.

14:01.710 --> 14:04.959
I'm sure Yuke would say the same thing.

14:04.960 --> 14:07.480
He'd tell us to complete our mission.

14:11.930 --> 14:14.030
I-Is everyone okay?

14:26.980 --> 14:28.750
So this is where you've been.

14:30.880 --> 14:33.920
Did you find something nice, Yuke?

14:34.570 --> 14:35.680
Mom?

14:36.120 --> 14:38.590
Yes, it's me. What's the matter?

14:40.600 --> 14:44.680
Look, it's getting cloudy. Let's get home.

14:48.950 --> 14:51.230
No, Mom! This is...

14:51.750 --> 14:53.840
What in the world is that?

14:54.420 --> 14:55.200
We gotta run!

14:58.390 --> 15:00.700
Yuke, run! Hurry!

15:14.970 --> 15:18.029
Yuke, come back! Don't go that way!

15:18.030 --> 15:18.680
Rain?!

15:25.960 --> 15:28.020
Yuke! Yuke!

15:28.570 --> 15:30.519
Rain... I...

15:30.520 --> 15:34.280
Don't talk. You almost turned
into a Shadow Stalker!

15:34.920 --> 15:35.900
Y-Yeah...

15:41.460 --> 15:44.539
Thank you. I'm okay now.

15:44.540 --> 15:47.759
I grabbed you the moment
you started to disappear.

15:47.760 --> 15:49.550
That brought me along with you.

15:50.720 --> 15:52.519
That scared me, though.

15:52.520 --> 15:56.389
I don't know what I'd do if
you became a Shadow Stalker.

15:56.390 --> 15:58.589
Me, too. It was...

15:58.590 --> 16:01.180
I guess it's your whole
world turning inside-out.

16:01.730 --> 16:03.979
You think the others are okay?

16:03.980 --> 16:05.629
I don't know.

16:05.630 --> 16:08.739
But you're okay now, right?

16:08.740 --> 16:09.820
Of course.

16:12.720 --> 16:14.989
The Abyss Gate is this way.

16:14.990 --> 16:17.249
The others are in this direction, too.

16:17.250 --> 16:20.200
Their presences are close.
I can sense them, too.

16:21.280 --> 16:22.709
Hey, Yuke...

16:22.710 --> 16:23.949
What is it?

16:23.950 --> 16:25.450
It's all over your face.

16:27.920 --> 16:29.769
You're so easy to read.

16:29.770 --> 16:32.570
What are you hiding this time?

16:33.270 --> 16:34.210
I can't say.

16:34.990 --> 16:36.210
Not even to me?

16:37.260 --> 16:38.470
Not even to you.

16:38.980 --> 16:40.840
I'm the only one here right now.

16:44.410 --> 16:46.730
It's something you can't even tell me?

16:47.660 --> 16:51.099
Sorry. The truth is,
I want to just say it...

16:51.100 --> 16:54.980
but if I do, I'll end up taking
advantage of you all again.

16:55.340 --> 16:57.480
We want you to rely on us more.

16:57.940 --> 17:00.259
You're such a scaredy-cat.

17:00.260 --> 17:03.989
Well, I am scared.
I'm scared of losing you.

17:03.990 --> 17:06.510
I'm scared of losing the life I have now.

17:07.050 --> 17:10.250
I want to be with you all forever,
and I want us always smiling.

17:11.050 --> 17:13.580
Okay. I won't ask again.

17:14.620 --> 17:15.580
You're sure?

17:16.130 --> 17:19.460
You don't want to say it, right?
So it's fine.

17:21.390 --> 17:24.550
Let's go. Everyone's worried.

17:34.000 --> 17:36.149
Yuke! Rain!

17:36.150 --> 17:38.530
You're all right! And Rain, too!

17:38.940 --> 17:40.150
Thank goodness!

17:40.450 --> 17:42.029
Sorry for the wait.

17:42.030 --> 17:43.410
And for worrying y—

17:44.660 --> 17:45.999
Ow...

17:46.000 --> 17:48.429
You have no idea how worried we were!

17:48.430 --> 17:49.540
About you, too, Rain!

17:50.080 --> 17:51.539
Yeah. Sorry.

17:51.540 --> 17:55.450
Sorry, but hey, we did find
each other again, didn't we?

17:56.210 --> 17:57.259
Uncle Saga?

17:57.260 --> 18:00.300
You sure took your time, Yuke.

18:00.850 --> 18:02.800
Well, things happened.

18:06.050 --> 18:09.609
Welcome back, Yuke and Rain.

18:09.610 --> 18:12.719
Knowing you, I figured you'd be fine,

18:12.720 --> 18:14.190
but I was still worried.

18:14.500 --> 18:16.889
I was almost swallowed up by Tenebre,

18:16.890 --> 18:19.190
but Rain saved me.

18:19.510 --> 18:24.499
I see. So Achromatic Darkness
tried to get rid of you.

18:24.500 --> 18:26.879
It considers you a threat.

18:26.880 --> 18:28.870
That's my nephew for you.

18:29.170 --> 18:31.689
Should that make me happy?

18:31.690 --> 18:34.179
Well? Did you remember anything?

18:34.180 --> 18:35.959
Yes, something bad.

18:35.960 --> 18:38.500
Then you must know what that is.

18:56.790 --> 18:57.940
You do know, right?

19:00.310 --> 19:02.549
Even I can kind of tell.

19:02.550 --> 19:05.930
It's the same as the presence
Yuke was giving off earlier.

19:07.080 --> 19:10.249
Uncle Saga, what's beyond that?

19:10.250 --> 19:11.840
Isn't it the Abyss Gate?

19:12.360 --> 19:15.540
It couldn't give off
such an ominous aura...

19:16.460 --> 19:18.040
It's the Abyss Gate.

19:26.060 --> 19:28.589
Seems like you haven't told them yet.

19:28.590 --> 19:30.890
I can't drag them into it.

19:31.390 --> 19:34.810
How can any nephew of mine be so
ignorant about what women want?

19:35.130 --> 19:36.890
They want you to drag them into it.

19:37.880 --> 19:40.310
Love takes a different form for everyone.

19:40.720 --> 19:42.249
Hey, well said.

19:42.250 --> 19:46.649
Well, whatever you choose,
I'll just do what I need to do.

19:46.650 --> 19:50.700
It'd be for the best if I could
handle it all myself, after all.

19:52.670 --> 19:56.679
Why are you so popular with
the ladies when I'm not?

19:56.680 --> 19:59.949
What are you talking about?
Women were crazy about you!

19:59.950 --> 20:01.250
Figured me out, huh?

20:02.140 --> 20:07.630
But I never had any women who'd
follow me into the depths of hell.

20:21.340 --> 20:23.770
Everything's ready. Shall we?

20:24.100 --> 20:26.479
Yeah. Begin streaming!

20:26.480 --> 20:28.030
Understood!

20:29.990 --> 20:33.680
We have to believe this stream is
reaching everyone above ground.

20:34.410 --> 20:38.209
Clover is about to head for the deepest
depths of Achromatic Darkness,

20:38.210 --> 20:40.000
the Abyss Gate.

20:40.420 --> 20:43.909
This isn't quite what I expected, though.

20:43.910 --> 20:45.170
Yes...

20:45.430 --> 20:47.499
It's a bit scary.

20:47.500 --> 20:52.059
This sense of denial and oppression,
the presence of what feels like hate...

20:52.060 --> 20:54.389
It's a lot like the door to a floor boss.

20:54.390 --> 20:57.889
Yeah. I think that's an
appropriate way to put it.

20:57.890 --> 21:01.650
Well, seeing is believing.
Let's check it out.

